# Optional: enables the "Sync with Google Drive" option.
# Create a Web OAuth Client ID in Google Cloud Console (Drive API enabled),
# add your origins (https://barelytrack.vercel.app and http://localhost:5173),
# then paste the client id here (and set it in the Vercel project env).
# Left unset, the Google Drive option is simply hidden.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
